### 用 VS Code 的 REST Client 外掛開啟此檔，點每段上方的 "Send Request" 即可執行
@base = http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/v1

### 健康檢查
GET {{base}}/health

### 登入（回應裡的 token 會自動存到 login 變數）
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"username": "nurse01", "password": "nurse1234"}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### 低庫存清單
GET {{base}}/items?low_stock=1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 搜尋
GET {{base}}/items?q=口罩&page=1&per_page=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 新增
POST {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "MS-0401",
  "name": "生理食鹽水 500ml",
  "category": "其他",
  "unit": "瓶",
  "safety_stock": 100,
  "unit_price": 25,
  "expiry_date": "2027-06-30",
  "location": "E-02-01",
  "initial_quantity": 300
}

### 部分更新
PATCH {{base}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"safety_stock": 250}

### 出庫
POST {{base}}/items/1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "OUT", "quantity": 20, "department": "急診", "note": "夜班請領"}

### 故意出庫過量 → 409
POST {{base}}/items/1/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"type": "OUT", "quantity": 999999}

### 驗證錯誤 → 422
POST {{base}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"code": "x", "unit_price": -5}

### 統計
GET {{base}}/stats/summary?expiry_days=60
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 一般使用者刪除 → 403
DELETE {{base}}/items/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
